other. `test:asset-diet` is ~400 s (s1629: 406.9 s) and already pins `--workers=1`; **run it ALONE** (F-1537-1 — overlapping batteries contaminate both). **(B)** ⚠️ **PIPELINE-DRY: lanes a, b, d** — lane-a is `ahead=0` USABLE and free after this drain; the two never-run masters dated 2026-08-10 are still banner-marked DO-NOT-QUEUE truncated drafts (`lane-agentreel1-door-tape`, `lane-agent-reels-emitter`) — **re-author from scratch, do not dispatch.** **(C)** ⓘ Housekeeping, unowned and harmless: `node` pid **61446** still LISTENS on **5241** with a DELETED working directory (`PWD=…/gate-s1455`), inherited from s1630 and still there. One deliberate `kill 61446` closes it; I again did not kill a process I don’t own, and **5188 was free for my gate**. 👤 **Robin owes (unchanged, never blocking):** the F-1620-6 letter, lane-d attempt-3 verdict, turret-feel + water-feel playtests, Mac full-regression evidence, favicon 16px eyeball. 🔺 **OWNER’S DESK — 17 awaiting a word.** 🔺 **F-1631-3** — **NEW, and the only time-critical one: Codex credits are exhausted until Aug 16; buy now or accept six days with no implemented code?** 🔺 **F-1625-4** — what should the 25 MB release budget actually GOVERN? (now load-bearing for A: f1631-1 deliberately refuses to settle it) 🔺 **F-1620-6** · 🔺 **F-1617-1** · 🔺 **F-DOOR-6** · 🔺 **F-1608-2** · 🔺 **F-1193-3** · 🔺 **F-1501-3** · 🔺 **F-1601-1** · 🔺 **F-1510-1** · 🔺 **F-E2S-3** · 🔺 **F-1536-2** · 🔺 **F-1591-1** · 🔺 **F-1507-1** · 🔺 **F-E2S-4** · 🔺 **F-1101-1** · 🔺 **F-1166-1** — all 16 re-checked with `desk-state-audit --status` against s1630’s ARCHIVED line-1: **CLOSED=0 · OPEN=0 · BOTH=0 · OPEN-DESK-ONLY=16 · UNRECORDED=0** — nothing carried that should have been dropped, none a ghost. **F-1631-1 and F-1631-2 are fire-side and do NOT join the desk; F-1631-3 DOES, because it spends money.**
